## 3. Purpose of This License

BijMantra has required significant personal time, personal funding, infrastructure cost, AI tooling cost, research effort, experimentation, and long-term development work.

The purpose of this License is to preserve public visibility of the project while ensuring that meaningful use of BijMantra contributes to its financial sustainability.

BijMantra’s long-term mission includes public-interest agricultural impact. However, the Project must first become financially sustainable in order to survive, improve, validate, and serve that mission responsibly. For this reason, licensing is structured around paid and negotiated use rather than automatic free access.

